Each of the eight guest artifacts was copied with `COPY :F0:ADRTRN.<ext>
TO :HP:` and captured from the simulator PTP socket. The console stayed
connected until all copies were complete. Disconnecting afterward caused the
simulator's known monitor socket I/O error during shutdown; the completed
artifacts and canonical source disk images were unaffected.
